amended_header_assertions = "program_replay::actual_leaves validates the record-v2 header and retains independent witness digest and leaf/node-root checks; captured_functions uses the header-aware decoder. repair_22_31_259::pinned_dispute_versions_replay_after_fee_update_upgrade_and_archive_restart carries the captured header in OPEN/TRANSITION/TERMINAL evidence. repair_22_31_564::assert_replay_fuel restores identity from the decoded header before all original fuel equations. repair_22_31_569::assert_host_boundaries restores header and full memory before all host-status and edge-byte assertions. market_tests::Committed::{evidence,commitment} and Execution::capture use the real captured header, including divergent leaf re-encoding. repair_22_31_577 preserves the live-memory comparisons, exactly 128 changed chunks and host-path refusal assertions; it adds header mismatch, truncation, trailing-byte and exact-size bounds checks. The former boundary_payload_codec_is_lossless_canonical_and_bounded test is retained unchanged in the previous_format diagnostic module of repair_22_31_577, used solely to measure the former layout; production has no packing codec."
consumer_context = "Committed leaves stay raw compact v2 fields. Individual boundary transport requires the record header: decode_with_header reads a raw leaf; decode_untrusted reads a context envelope. Market evidence carries the header once before proofs, and live observers receive an explicit context envelope. A raw leaf without its header refuses Encoding rather than inventing constants."

