repair_2_implementation = "The remaining immutable ABI authority/oracle preimage, meter budget/prices, payment metadata and metering schedule are explicit canonical header fields, checked for equality on every capture. Semantic leaves carry mutable ABI effects, the runtime tail, and the mutable meter once; ABI digest/length and runtime usage/remaining CPU are reconstructed from the same ABI and meter witnesses. Storage current cells are rebuilt from the committed baseline and the single canonical overlay; frozen/access namespace sets remain carried verbatim. Composition domain and code hash come from the header, with graph flags and graph payloads remaining in the leaf. No packing, dictionary, fallback, profile widening or changed fuel binding is introduced."
