repair_observed = "At bf88055362aa65ee835a4fa59f59170b7895994b, build and 58 dependent-crate checks passed; hf-done exited 1, verify_cmd exit 101, /out/logs/verify-1.log. All carried suites passed. The executor still refused capture witness bytes observed=1049404 permitted=1048576 leaf_length=4998. The sandbox admitted 128 calls, leaf_total=1014715, record_total=1019522, and measured middle step 456 as 4635 bytes (semantic host 113, storage 89, composition 2), then its adjudicator guest faulted before its expected-success assertion."
repair_implementation = "The host-path proof now resolves the actual validated sandbox module used to produce the record. Recompiling it after validating the adjudicator in the same WasmEngine shifted wasmi's compiled function identifiers, which native execute_step compares with the captured legacy frame identifiers. The adjudicator continues through the real ABI-v5 host; all success, holds, forged-memory, OPEN and TERMINAL assertions are retained. The independently successful sandbox capture also executes every record-level header-binding assertion."
